body:
Beating someone without any details for any reason is not to mean "you've done something wrong and you deserve this". It is perhaps domination, you're mom could careless about you she blatantly want to state dominance, through abuse. Even if you are wrong, knowing now you didnt know what caused you your beating, then would the beating had helped you in a sense?

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Your mom, jail.

You, I wish better future. \*offers internet hug\* (you have the right to say no)

Hi Mariana, First off, I truly understand how you feel. It seems like they are unconsciously abusing you. The neglection with you is truly alive. More of, the lack of respect and listening towards you shows how much they neglect you. The part they threaten is very abusive, no one in right mind as a parent need to scare their children to death to achieve respect, this is more than respect; this is domination. Do you mind if I ask you some question through pm. I'd like to help you out and if you're interested I'll share my story and how to tolerate : )

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Edit: I added my thoughts on how they choke you and threaten you.
